{"title":"2026 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Fast_and_Easy_🔥🚀)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Fast and Easy 🔥🚀)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(FAST_AND_QUICK_EXPLANATION!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (FAST AND QUICK EXPLANATION!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_in_Chinese_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution in Chinese by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Brynn's savings decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3f28c43f724016e746abeabde028e0149f90b99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> in July, then increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/3/6f33bafbe9418f0abcd1b50077ff09a02e59a5f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> in August. Brynn's savings are now what percent of the original amount?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/670a0db99fce1d82126844c1eb26e0152ef00353.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 80 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 90 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 100 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 110 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be Byron's original amount. We see that Byron had <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a2fb4bcc6090bd04da6e4dbe232e0374589212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.8x$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> in July. Then, he increased his savings by HALF of how much he had as of July which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/9/2690c2ae38fb1e483f1f1314d3f2c5207dd62040.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/d/d0d10f9673d372945d526281ed0f5aec6e39b68d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4x + 0.8x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c45faa7d96e387a921e879576c8bf148bc2063a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" />, so his August savings are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3efdbc70e1978a1ef97f41103d5f224ed904a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(E) } 120 }\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. \n</p><p>~Ingeniouspeacock36\n</p><p>We see that the change is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/4/3d46913fba955198099e73b0ef9e38da32ee4598.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-0.2)(1+0.5) = 0.8 \\cdot 1.5 = 1.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"271\" height=\"20\" />. That is an increase of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, so his August savings are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3efdbc70e1978a1ef97f41103d5f224ed904a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(E) } 120 }\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" /> of his original savings.\n</p><p>~OlympiadMaster\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's assume Brynn has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc6a1da7f18069a90481296d18af7ca979fe3854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"35\" height=\"14\" /> at the start. In July, he lost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, so he lost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/5/555360df10d7f3448442d43c277f763b0d1236bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"14\" />, so he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/4/d7483e4ff7a7f971463fd84aa7afd7c6bc2183d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100-20=80$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"109\" height=\"13\" /> dollars left. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> percent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars, so he gained <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars in August, so now he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/1/9a19c7d7c58976853f617a33e6117df1c2b89019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80+40=120$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> dollars, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0a61d342c60948459cc886ed29a6204040783c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$120\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"16\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> dollars, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3efdbc70e1978a1ef97f41103d5f224ed904a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(E) } 120 }\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~Yuhao2012\n</p><p>We can also do it just with percentages. He has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bd818354ff89f378b1c6b3d4df72f3c8c508b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> then loses <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />, meaning he now has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/7/bb7e03ccc8985ba9d029ea4add6e3e15ab9a953a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />. Then he gains <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> percent of our NEW amount (which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> percent) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> percent of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> percent, so we add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to get our answer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3efdbc70e1978a1ef97f41103d5f224ed904a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(E) } 120 }\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~pereena\n</p><p>You can also do it with fractions. You can say you have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57b95f6c368a0d7c0551ea6fb8c5478ec96fa72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> at the beginning, then losing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> would result in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d32bd09a562223dc1c8ceeb88e3b482eba81aea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{80}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d32bd09a562223dc1c8ceeb88e3b482eba81aea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{80}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e5e86f36d9d8085cb967f5d7304dbb5bed822f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />. Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/e/e6e5e86f36d9d8085cb967f5d7304dbb5bed822f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{40}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" /> to the original <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/2/d32bd09a562223dc1c8ceeb88e3b482eba81aea5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{80}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/4/ec4d742e57f155b123408310aa590b533c35c781.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{120}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/e/a3efdbc70e1978a1ef97f41103d5f224ed904a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ \\textbf{(E) } 120 }\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"89\" height=\"30\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57b95f6c368a0d7c0551ea6fb8c5478ec96fa72.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{100}{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"33\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~Broie, fixed fraction by anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let Brynn's savings be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Then, in July from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> his savings went down <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/2/f825d99374e5ad8b12662107f27ae0590f37782f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - \\frac{1}{5}x = \\frac{4}{5}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"106\" height=\"38\" />. From that amount, it increased <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> in August, meaning we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/0/68095bd795c3cf1b2c2cccd94ca2fce55aaf031b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{10}x + \\frac{4}{10}x = \\frac{12}{10}x = \\frac{6}{5}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"194\" height=\"38\" /> remaining. Of the total <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/f/99f1958af8ea7f727ca945bfb3279fce7f75e02d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\frac{6}{5}x}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"27\" height=\"42\" />, we see that the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> cancel out and the increase is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/f/e4fc4c669518d5da6185c95ea46645895843844d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/7/477ebe53810c3d762d38e1a513e388281ef11ad5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{120}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />%\n</p><p>~Pinotation (your so tuff ~ jimmy_io) (ty bro &lt;3 ~Pinotation)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U\">https://youtu.be/gzXlOkLl24U</a>\n</p><p>~TheSmartGreekMathDude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk\">https://youtu.be/nY1hhVbEeBk</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_STEM_Simplified\">Video Solution by STEM Simplified</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by STEM Simplified\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=50nBi15QTGI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=50nBi15QTGI</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Fast_and_Easy_.F0.9F.94.A5.F0.9F.9A.80.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Fast_and_Easy_🔥🚀)\">Video Solution (Fast and Easy 🔥🚀)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Fast and Easy 🔥🚀)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DpREPWYKBXQ&amp;list=PLpxy89D2tvVpAjkqMVFD_4gKzoEwPoj9l&amp;index=27\">2026 AMC8 #4</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://piacademyus.org/\">By piacademyus.org</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Thinking_Feet\">Video Solution by Thinking Feet</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Thinking Feet\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/bl7pf3LTDz0\">https://youtu.be/bl7pf3LTDz0</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28FAST_AND_QUICK_EXPLANA